  replay.  Entries are mean $\pm$ sample standard deviation across the ten seed
  triplets, in degrees.}
  \label{tab:direction-ou3-rms}
  \footnotesize
  \setlength{\tabcolsep}{3.0pt}
  \renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.06}
  \begin{tabular}{@{}lrrr@{}}
    \toprule
    Case & $H_s$ [m] & Axis RMS & Directed RMS \\
    \midrule
    JONSWAP    & 0.27 & $13.79\pm0.98$ & $15.18\pm1.00$ \\
    JONSWAP    & 1.50 & $12.03\pm0.53$ & $19.54\pm2.12$ \\
    JONSWAP    & 4.00 & $11.44\pm0.55$ & $23.85\pm1.77$ \\
    JONSWAP    & 8.50 & $11.27\pm0.39$ & $26.92\pm2.47$ \\
